###Block: Descriptions
Animate Sand.MOD	DESC:Sand attacks your foes.
Antimagic Bastion.MOD	DESC:As per antimagic field, except it applies to one type of magic.
Banquet of Ashes.MOD	DESC:Curse prevents target from drawing nourishment from food.
Barge of Ra.MOD	DESC:Summons a flying barge that carries (CASTERLEVEL*400) pounds.
Blessing of Shade.MOD	DESC:Wraps target in protective shadows.
Call Animal.MOD	DESC:Summons a Tiny or smaller animal to serve as a guide or messenger.
Call Corpse.MOD	DESC:Pulls a corpse from the ground to appear at the caster's feet.
Call Sphinx.MOD	DESC:Calls the nearest sphinx to aid you.
Circle of Bes.MOD	DESC:Cooperative spell creating the effects of protection from evil/good and bless to all involved in the circle.
Detect Divine Blood.MOD	DESC:Detects presence of divine blood within 60 feet.
Endure.MOD	DESC:Bestows the Endurance feat on a subject.
Eye of Ra.MOD	DESC:Caster gains a bird's eye view and a +10 bonus to Spot checks to detect hidden creatures.
Eyes of Isis.MOD	DESC:Automatically identifies a spell as it is cast.
Flight of the Ba.MOD	DESC:Caster releases his ba in the form of an incorporeal bird.
Heart Clutch.MOD	DESC:Target's heart stops and tears free from its body.
Jackal's Bite.MOD	DESC:Grants target a bite attack that deals 1d8 points of damage.
Know Deity.MOD	DESC:Caster learns the subject's patron deity.
Know Superior.MOD	DESC:Discover to whom target creature answers.
Meld into Sand.MOD	DESC:You and your gear merge into sand.
Mental Map.MOD	DESC:You recall directions with absolute clarity.
Minor Miracle.MOD	DESC:Alters reality, within spell limits.
Moment of Cunning.MOD	DESC:Subject gains a +2 bonus to his Int for (CASTERLEVEL/2) rounds.
Moment of Endurance.MOD	DESC:Subject gains a +2 bonus to his Con for (CASTERLEVEL/2) rounds.
Moment of Grace.MOD	DESC:Subject gains a +2 bonus to his Dex for (CASTERLEVEL/2) rounds.
Moment of Splendor.MOD	DESC:Subject gains a +2 bonus to his Cha for (CASTERLEVEL/2) rounds.
Moment of Strength.MOD	DESC:Subject gains a +2 bonus to his Str for (CASTERLEVEL/2) rounds.
Moment of Wisdom.MOD	DESC:Subject gains a +2 bonus to his Wis for (CASTERLEVEL/2) rounds.
Pebble to Boulder.MOD	DESC:Transforms a thrown pebble into a full-sized boulder dealing (min(CASTERLEVEL,15))d6 damage.
Phantom Chariot.MOD	DESC:A pair of magical horses and a chariot appears for (CASTERLEVEL) hours.
Quench Thirst.MOD	DESC:Alleviates target's need for water for one day.
Quick Scribe.MOD	DESC:Creates writing tools and papyrus.
Ray of Dehydration.MOD	DESC:Deals (min(CASTERLEVEL,20))d6 nonlethal damage and dehydrates target.
Ray of Thirst.MOD	DESC:Deals 1d6 nonlethal damage and dehydrates target.
Renenutet's Whisper.MOD	DESC:You may react to one event before it takes place.
Revive.MOD	DESC:Makes desert travel easier.
Root.MOD	DESC:You establish a plant in any kind of earth.
Sand-Swim.MOD	DESC:Lets you swim through and breathe within sand.
Screaming Sandstorm.MOD	DESC:Sandstorm deals damage and reduces visibility.
Searing Touch.MOD	DESC:Melee touch attack deals (min(CASTERLEVEL,5))d6 damage.
Shadow Step.MOD	DESC:Teleport to any place your shadow touches.
Shape Sand.MOD	DESC:Create shapes and objects out of sand.
Silent Scribe.MOD	DESC:Creates writing tools and papyrus and silently transcribes spoken words or thoughts.
Skin of Bronze.MOD	DESC:Ignore 15 points of damage per attack.
Solar Scourge.MOD	DESC:Target creature becomes sensitive to heat.
Summon Focus.MOD	DESC:Summons a focus for casting spells.
Tanglefoot Touch.MOD	DESC:Temporarily reduce target's Dex by 1d6 points.
Temporary Oasis.MOD	DESC:Creates a small oasis that lasts for (CASTERLEVEL) hour.
Tireless Vigil.MOD	DESC:Grants a +2 bonus to all Listen and Spot checks for 1 hour.
Touch of Starvation.MOD	DESC:Subject takes 1d6 nonlethal damage, and is subject to starvation.
Turn to Sand.MOD	DESC:You transform into a mass of sand for (CASTERLEVEL) rounds.
Ward of Anubis.MOD	DESC:Array of magical eff ects protect a structure from thievery.

